project csm001:
  version 9
  title "Restore character authoring and migrate frozen ready V2 characters to strict V3"
  description "Deliver accepted focused create, revise and V2-to-V3 migration through the common kernel, with protected meaning and complete server reconciliation. Connect the real provider and consumer paths before live proof. Preserve failed legacy Stage history without making more V2 repair a prerequisite. Restore the frozen characters and verify strict V3 authoring cutover. Provider work, deployment, candidate acceptance and production activation remain separate effects."
  as_of 2026-09-15
  duration_unit point
  velocity 1p/1d
  finish cm114

