task cc304 cm207 -> cm304:
  title "Connect focused authoring to real create revise and migration consumers"
  description "After exact ADR-0032 acceptance and owner acceptance of proposed ADR-0033 plus conforming implementation-design revision 6, implement the real provider effect driver and wire the accepted kernel and character adapter into queued create/revise and migration entrypoints. Connect owner-authenticated answer/retry endpoints and UI, safe candidate and mode-specific semantic-diff presentation, and final acceptance without conflating answers with acceptance. Preserve source, target, adapter, semantic-resource, pricing and token-estimator identities plus accounting, request lifecycle, receipts, fences, protected meaning and final reconciliation. Treat provider transport and worker execution values as startup runtime Config; do not add a durable Config registry, snapshot, generation identity or Config-only migration. Controlled HTTP replies must traverse real API/UI, worker, driver and persistence for all three modes, focused recovery, bounded termination, stale results, answer continuation and source-based new-run retry. Do not reinstate the unsupported 60-second provider or 240-second whole-attempt semantics. Keep new production policy inactive until B14; candidate deployment must preserve current behavior without adding legacy V2 repair. No paid call or deployment. Component-only fixtures cannot complete this task."
  duration 6p
  status suspended
  owner "codex"
  source "docs/character-semantic-migration-plan-revision-7.md"
  requires:
    cr001 1

